OL,3,GNorthern Ireland                       
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with rain in the east    
OL,6,Fthrough the morning before turning dry 
OL,7,Fin the afternoon. Further west will be 
OL,8,Fmostly dry with some brighter spells.  
OL,9,FLight winds.                           
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will be dry through the    
OL,12,Fevening and overnight with cloud       
OL,13,Fbreaking up to give some clear spells. 
OL,14,FBecoming breezy around exposed coasts. 
OL,16,CThursday:FA dry and mostly cloudy      
OL,17,Fmorning. Cloudy in the afternoon with  
OL,18,Frain, heavy at times, spreading        
OL,19,Feastwards. Winds strengthening and     
OL,20,Fbecoming strong in places.             
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
