OL,3,GNorthern Ireland                       
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FMostly   
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells and winds        
OL,7,Fbecoming light on Friday. A dry and    
OL,8,Fcloudy start Saturday then rain        
OL,9,Fspreading east later. Sunny spells and 
OL,10,Fa few showers on Sunday.               
